BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lcra-water-rules-public-comments-close-20260901@calendars.changesaround
 me.com
DTSTAMP:20260904T010022Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
SUMMARY:LCRA: Water rules public comments close
URL:https://www.lcra.org/water/water-related-rules-and-regulations-for-publ
 ic-comment/
DESCRIPTION:Water-related rules and regulations LCRA is accepting public co
 mments on a proposed change to its firm water rate. Proposed rate increase
 : from $165 to $175 per acre-foot. Impacts customers such as municipalitie
 s\, industries\, temporary water users and lakeside residential domestic u
 sers that purchase water from the Highland Lakes or the lower Colorado Riv
 er through firm water supply contracts with LCRA. Driven by inc…\n\nSubm
 it comments: https://lcra.formstack.com/forms/lcra_firm_water_rate_comment
 _form\n\nDetails: https://www.lcra.org/water/water-related-rules-and-regul
 ations-for-public-comment/
CATEGORIES:comment-window
X-CAM-ORG:lcra
END:VEVENT
